        {
          "text": "Ngiyakukwenza ugange lwethusi olubiyelweyo kulaba bantu; bayakulwa nawe, kepha abayikukwehlula; ngokuba nginawe ukuba ngikukhulule, ngikusindise,” usho uJehova.",
